xeondesktop (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Aero (Windows 7) style with blurred glass on a GPU, Aero Snap, Peek and
    Shake, and Windows 7's icon taskbar with pinned programs and jump lists.
  * Luna colour schemes measured from Windows XP: Silver, Olive Green and
    Energy Blue; all 22 classic colour schemes with checked colours.
  * Control Panel: every applet, Administrative Tools (Services, Event
    Viewer, Disk Management) and Scheduled Tasks.
  * Start menus: Search, Help and Support, Default Programs, Switch User,
    keyboard use; desktop icons with Customize Desktop and Auto Arrange.
  * Explorer: file operations, Details columns, Send To, Undo, Recycle Bin.
  * Sound scheme events, accessibility keys, title bar icons, icon theme,
    GTK theme and Qt style settings; Qt programs follow the desktop's look.
  * Session: systemd graphical-session.target, XDG autostart, VirtualBox's
    shared clipboard; software rendering on virtual machine GPUs.
  * Many fixes from a bug hunt, a headless UI test suite, and zero-warning
    GCC and Clang builds, debug and optimized.

 -- xeon <xeon.productions@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:15:43 +0000

